            "description": "Schedule screen payload:\n- dateStrip (horizontal dates + hasVisits dots)\n- selectedDateLabel (Today · Tue 30/06/2026)\n- totals (visits / planned hours / miles)\n- visits list (period · time range + statusTag)\n\nUses Bearer `{{accessToken}}`. Defaults to today (UTC)."
